{"id":"nc5igwykh4u7lz50fz7aumzm6","title":"12世纪中国诗人卢友与猫的文学交流","originalTitle":"The 12th‑century Chinese poet who was among the first to explore the inner lives of cats","summary":"12世纪的中国诗人卢友在其9000多首诗中创作了三首关于猫的诗，其中《赠猫》表达了他对猫的关怀和对猫个体性的认识。卢友通过诗作展现了与猫平等的关系，认为猫也有尊严和值得同情的一面，这与当时将猫视为仅需更换的捕鼠工具的观点不同。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-12thcentury-chinese-poet-explore-cats.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T23:40:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T00:51:35.850Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T00:51:35.850Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表"],"score":21,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"9f7bd348-de52-433d-8abc-00c43b147646","title":"12世纪诗人卢友通过诗歌探讨猫的个体性"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"9f7bd348-de52-433d-8abc-00c43b147646","title":"12世纪诗人卢友通过诗歌探讨猫的个体性"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fmEPf1Cx2P_w","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}